WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.273 --> 00:00:01.905
- [Man] Is it the early bird 
that gets the worm

00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:04.610
or is it the bird that matches
the sleep patterns of the worm

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.490
that gets the worm?

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.261
- Both.
- [Man] Okay.

00:00:07.261 --> 00:00:09.265
- There's so many ways to win.

00:00:09.265 --> 00:00:11.088
Look, there's people that 
have made the NBA

00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:13.730
that worked their face off
but had a little less talent

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:16.783
and then there's guys that 
just had so much

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.965
god damn talent that, 
yeah, they worked but

00:00:18.965 --> 00:00:20.815
there's just so many 
different ways to do it.

00:00:20.815 --> 00:00:24.035
The key is which bird 
knew themselves best.

00:00:25.586 --> 00:00:26.651
Got it?

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:27.888
That's the bird.

00:00:27.888 --> 00:00:29.027
The bird that's like,

00:00:29.027 --> 00:00:33.329
"Fuck it, my wings are short 
but I'll wake up earlier."

00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:34.063
You know?

00:00:34.063 --> 00:00:36.641
(laughter)

00:00:36.641 --> 00:00:37.909
That was good.

00:00:37.909 --> 00:00:39.861
(applause)

